2374-- **Pattern C:** WK (X+1, H), WP (X, H−1), BK (X, H−2), BP (X+1, H−1), with X = f.
2375-- **Both kings can shuttle.** Kg8–f8 and Kf6–g6 are safe (audit; PROVED by enumeration: every one of the
2376-  four king placements is legal and keeps both pawns guarded).
